---
import RootLayout from "../../layouts/RootLayout.astro";
---

<RootLayout title="Consulting — Chronopax" description="Cloud architecture, security infrastructure, and AI systems integration." width="md">
  <div class="page-header">
    <span class="eyebrow">Work with me</span>
    <h1>Consulting</h1>
  </div>

  <section class="intro-section">
    <h2>Let's build something worth building.</h2>
    <p>I work with organizations that need infrastructure done right — cloud
      architecture, security stacks, AI integration, and compliance frameworks
      that hold up under scrutiny. Based in San Diego. Available for contract
      and project-based engagements.</p>
    <p>If you're working on something interesting and need someone who has
      actually built this stuff — reach out.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Start a conversation →</a>
  </section>

  <section class="focus-section">
    <h2>Areas of focus</h2>
    <div class="focus-pills">
      <span class="pill">Cloud Architecture</span>
      <span class="pill">Security Infrastructure</span>
      <span class="pill">AI Systems Integration</span>
      <span class="pill">Compliance Frameworks</span>
      <span class="pill">Network Architecture</span>
      <span class="pill">Identity & Access Management</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="creds-section">
    <h2>Certifications</h2>
    <p>Verified credentials available on Credly.</p>
    <a href="https://www.credly.com/users/joseph-burley" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">View certifications →</a>
  </section>

  <section class="opportunity-section">
    <h2>Open to the right opportunity</h2>
    <p>Beyond project work, I'm selectively open to full-time roles where the
      work is genuinely interesting and the compensation reflects the level.
      If that sounds like your organization — LinkedIn is the best place to start.</p>
    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/burleyjoe/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">Connect on LinkedIn →</a>
  </section>

  <section class="support-section">
    <h2>Support the work</h2>
    <p>Interested in supporting ongoing open source projects?</p>
    <a href="https://patreon.com/Chronopax" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline">Support on Patreon →</a>
  </section>
</RootLayout>

<style lang="scss">
  .page-header {
    margin: 3rem 0 2rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-accent-teal);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .intro-section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);

    p {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.7;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }
  }

  .focus-section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .focus-pills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .pill {
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.9rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .creds-section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);

    p {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
  }

  .opportunity-section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);

    p {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.7;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
  }

  .support-section {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;

    p {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
  }

  .text-link {
    color: var(--color-accent-orange);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.9rem;

    &:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.5rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;

    &.btn-primary {
      background: var(--color-accent-orange);
      color: #fff;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-accent-orange);

      &:hover {
        background: var(--color-accent-orange-dark);
        border-color: var(--color-accent-orange-dark);
      }
    }

    &.btn-outline {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--color-text-primary);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border-hover);

      &:hover {
        border-color: var(--color-accent-orange);
        color: var(--color-accent-orange);
      }
    }
  }
</style>
